Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Scalar scattering with gravity and a cubic/quartic potential", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"b1138547-0ffa-4c97-93c6-4d1c644267d9"],

Cell["\<\
Tree-level p1 + p2 \[RightArrow] p3 + p4 scattering of identical real scalars \
of mass m. The action contains +\[Lambda]3 phi^3/3! +\[Lambda]4 phi^4/4! and \
the canonical massive scalar coupled to gravity. Start in a fresh kernel and \
evaluate from top to bottom. All momenta p1, p2, p3, p4 denote physical \
incoming or outgoing momenta as indicated. No loop calculation is performed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8d480533-ffbd-4ebb-ac83-2d2147b52eb0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Load FeynGrav", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"cd027244-3502-455c-bd31-5c294251b117"],

